  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police, through Bareskrim Polri, are investigating allegations of treason and illegal wiretapping targeting President Prabowo Subianto. As part of this comprehensive effort, investigators have executed search warrants at various properties located in Bogor and Tangerang. The investigation has reportedly drawn focus toward former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit, and authorities have already interrogated four individuals in connection with the suspected wiretapping plot. Law enforcement officials intended to hold a joint case review, known as an expose, with the Attorney General's Office to discuss the case status and potential suspect naming. However, this meeting has been rescheduled for the following week, as investigators continue to prioritize the collection of evidence and the assessment of alleged criminal conspiracy and operational preparations related to the treason claims.",
